HOW TO INSTALL WOLF SHAPER (Mac, VST3)
======================================

The easiest way is the installer, wolf-shaper-@RELEASE_TAG@-macos-universal.pkg,
from the same page as this zip:
https://github.com/sonic-weaponry/wolf-shaper/releases/tag/@RELEASE_TAG@

To install by hand instead:
1. Quit your DAW.
2. In Finder, choose Go > Go to Folder..., type /Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST3
   and press Return.
3. If a wolf-shaper.vst3 is already there, move it to the Trash first.
4. Drag wolf-shaper.vst3 from this folder into that folder. Your Mac may ask
   for your password.
5. Open your DAW and rescan your plugins (in Ableton Live: Settings >
   Plug-Ins > Rescan).

Projects saved on Windows will find this version. Mac projects saved with the
official Mac version of Wolf Shaper will show it as missing.

